{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4f7a1c9e2b6d8053",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -340,
      "y": -700,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# 积分方法\n\n这张图不是公式清单，而是按 **integrand 的结构** 选择改写方式。\n\n- 先走下方的选择与验算顺序\n- 原子卡保存公式、条件、反例和自检\n- 无穷端点或奇点的收敛问题另见 [[反常积分.canvas|反常积分]]\n\n**底线：** 变换后同步处理微分、上下限、定义域与分支；最后对候选原函数求导。"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c2e5a7d1f9b3046",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -300,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[积分方法选择|Choosing an integration method]]\nIdentify the task and domain, then simplify. Match complete chain factors; use parity or derivative pairs for suitable trigonometric powers. For quadratic radicals, check direct substitution before angle branches. Divide rational functions before partial fractions when needed. Use parts on products or a hidden factor $1$; a return must give an informative equation.\nVerify by differentiation, oriented bounds and separate singular limits. This is a useful sequence, not a complete algorithm.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先辨任务与定义域，再化简。识别完整复合导数；三角幂核奇偶或导数配对；二次根式先看直接换元，再选角度分支；有理式必要时长除；乘积或隐藏的 $1$ 可试分部，回到原式须形成有效方程。最后求导验算，核有向上下限及各个反常极限；顺序有用，但不保证穷尽成功。"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d6f8a3c5e7b9024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1050,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[换元积分|Integration by substitution]]\n\nThe direct route recognizes $f(g(x))g^{\\prime}(x)$ and sets $u=g(x)$. A missing factor cannot be invented; a valid inverse-branch substitution may still exist.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n直接路线识别完整复合导数，内层与微分一起换；不能凭空补因子，但仍可能有合法的反解换元。"
    },
    {
      "id": "2e7a9c4d6f1b3058",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1050,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[定积分换元|Definite substitution]]\n\nOn finite $[a,b]$ with $a<b$, a continuously differentiable $g$ and continuous $f$ on the whole image justify the composite formula. Bounds become $g(a)$ then $g(b)$; $g$ need not be monotone.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限区间上，内函数连续可微、外函数在完整像域连续，便可用复合公式；换限保留顺序，不要求内函数单调。"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c3e5g7i9k2m406",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1050,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[非单调换元需分支|Inverse branches in substitution]]\n\nIf the chosen route needs $x$ from $u=g(x)$, select valid inverse branches and track derivative signs and bound order. A remaining expression may already be a function of $u$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n若所选路线需要从新变量反解原变量，应选合法逆分支并保留导数符号和上下限顺序；残余表达式也可能直接写成新变量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "3f8b1d5e7a2c4069",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -600,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正弦余弦幂积分|Sine and cosine powers]]\nFor nonnegative integer exponents, an odd sine power leaves $\\sin x\\,dx$ for $u=\\cos x$; an odd cosine power leaves $\\cos x\\,dx$ for $u=\\sin x$. If both powers are even, use power reduction. Both zero gives the integrand $1$. Negative or fractional powers need separate domain and sign checks.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非负整数幂中，奇次正弦或余弦可留下导数配对因子；两次幂均偶时降幂，均零时被积函数为 $1$。负数或分数幂须另查定义域和符号。"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a9c2e6f8b3d1074",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -120,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正切正割幂积分|Tangent and secant powers]]\nFor $\\tan^m x\\sec^n x$, take nonnegative integers $m,n$ and an interval with $\\cos x\\ne0$. If $m=n=0$, the integrand is just $1$ without that restriction.\nIf $n\\ge2$ is even, reserve $\\sec^2x\\,dx=d(\\tan x)$.\nIf $m$ is odd and $n\\ge1$, reserve $\\sec x\\tan x\\,dx=d(\\sec x)$.\nThese are sufficient routes, not all cases; cotangent/cosecant pairs carry minus signs.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n取非负整数 $m,n$，在 $\\cos x\\ne0$ 的区间讨论；均零时只是常数 $1$，无此限制。先确认完整导数因子确实存在。正偶数正割幂，或奇数正切幂且至少有一个正割因子，分别给出两条多项式路线；不是穷尽分类，余切与余割导数另带负号。"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b1d3f7a9c4e2058",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 440,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[三角代换|Trigonometric substitution]]\nComplete the square if needed. For $a>0$, quadratic radicals suggest:\n- $\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}$: $x=a\\sin\\theta$\n- $\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}$: $x=a\\tan\\theta$\n- $\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}$: choose $x=\\pm a\\sec\\theta$ by branch.\nChoose an angle range before removing absolute values; transform the differential and bounds. Roots in a denominator still exclude their zeros. Check for a shorter direct substitution first.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先配方并取 $a>0$，再选代换与合法角度范围；正负分支决定绝对值、微分和换限方向。根式若在分母，零点仍须排除。"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c2e4a8b1d5f3069",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[部分分式积分|Partial fractions]]\nFor a real rational function, record its domain, divide first if needed, then factor the denominator. Include every repeated power; each irreducible quadratic power needs a general linear numerator. Recombine to check. Cancellation does not fill original holes, and decomposition does not make poles integrable.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实有理函数先记定义域，必要时长除，再因式分解。重复因子逐幂列项，不可约二次因子的各次幂配一般一次分子；重新通分验算，保留原孔点与极点边界。"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d3f5b1c7e2a4068",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 750,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[分部积分|Integration by parts]]\n\nFor continuously differentiable $u,v$ on finite $[a,b]$, $a<b$, the product rule transfers one derivative. Choose a computable primitive $v$ and retain both integrals’ bounds.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限闭区间上两函数连续可微时，乘积法则把一次求导转移给另一因子；选定可求的原函数，并保留两积分的上下限。\n\n$$\\int_a^b uv^{\\prime}\\,dx=[uv]_a^b-\\int_a^b vu^{\\prime}\\,dx.$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2d4f6h8j1l3n507",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1230,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[循环分部积分|Cyclic integration by parts]]\n\nWith a fixed lower limit, a valid finite cycle may yield $I=G+cI$. For a known constant $c\\ne1$, solve $I=G/(1-c)$; $c=1$ does not determine $I$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定下限，让各次计算指向同一积分函数。有限循环得到已知常系数的方程后，系数不等于一才可移项求解；等于一时不能由此确定原积分。"
    }
  ],
